  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "hypersonic-scramjets",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tScramjet Hypersonic Flow Physics Emulator Dataset\n\t\n\nA dataset of 6,877 steady-state hypersonic flow simulations of parametrically\nvaried scramjet geometries, produced with JAX-Fluids (https://github.com/tumaer/JAXFLUIDS) as part of a fully GPU-based CFD workflow intended for\ntraining and evaluating physics emulators.\nThe current version of the dataset contains the irregular-grid data used for training the AB-UPT emulator (https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.09692) from the paper.\nWe will\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/paischer101/hypersonic-scramjets.",
  "alternateName": [
    "paischer101/hypersonic-scramjets",
    "Scramjet Hypersonic Flow Physics Emulator Dataset"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Fabian Paischer",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/paischer101"
  },
